-- สวิตช์: เปิดแล้วรางเป็นสีแร่หลอม (ค่อย ๆ จางเข้า) ปุ่มกลมเลื่อนไปขวา
local function makeSwitch(parent: Instance, value: boolean, onChange: (boolean) -> ())
	local track = new("TextButton", {
		Text = "",
		AutoButtonColor = false,
		AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0),
		Position = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0),
		Size = UDim2.fromOffset(40, 22),
		BackgroundColor3 = Theme.off,
		Parent = parent,
	}, { corner(11) })
	local fill = new("Frame", {
		Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),
		BackgroundColor3 = Color3.new(1, 1, 1),
		BackgroundTransparency = if value then 0 else 1,
		Parent = track,
	}, { corner(11), gradient(EMBER) })
	local knob = new("Frame", {
		Size = UDim2.fromOffset(16, 16),
		Position = if value then UDim2.fromOffset(21, 3) else UDim2.fromOffset(3, 3),
		BackgroundColor3 = if value then Color3.new(1, 1, 1) else Theme.sub,
		ZIndex = 3,
		Parent = track,
	}, { corner(8) })
	local api = { value = value }
	function api.set(newValue: boolean, silent: boolean?)
		api.value = newValue
		tween(fill, { BackgroundTransparency = if newValue then 0 else 1 })
		tween(knob, {
			Position = if newValue then UDim2.fromOffset(21, 3) else UDim2.fromOffset(3, 3),
			BackgroundColor3 = if newValue then Color3.new(1, 1, 1) else Theme.sub,
		})
		if not silent then
			onChange(newValue)
		end
	end
	connect(track.Activated, function()
		api.set(not api.value)
	end)
	return api
end

local function toggleRow(page: Instance, key: string, title: string, desc: string?, onChange: ((boolean) -> ())?): Row
	local holder = card(page)
	local _, status = textColumn(holder, UDim.new(1, -54), title, desc)
	local switch = makeSwitch(holder, config[key] == true, function(value)
		config[key] = value
		saveConfig()
		if not value then
			status.Visible = false
		end
		if onChange then
			onChange(value)
		end
	end)
	table.insert(binders, function()
		if switch.value ~= (config[key] == true) then
			switch.set(config[key] == true)
		end
	end)
	local row = {}
	function row.setStatus(message: string?, color: Color3?)
		showStatus(status, message, color)
	end
	function row.set(value: boolean)
		switch.set(value)
	end
	return row :: any
end

